1348614692687989},{"y":0.3646960866590363,"w":0.1960784339904785,"text":"the street. The day he was","x":0.18954248373097712,"h":0.011757401602155104},{"w":0.34858386993408197,"h":0.014635333014368368,"x":0.056644883987207385,"text":"released, he walked • the prison car park and","y":0.37635303884076954},{"y":0.3909242297679828,"w":0.35729846954345706,"h":0.013322231473771873,"text":"smashed the windows on five cars in the car park.","x":0.056644887886223357},{"x":0.058823533448339342,"y":0.40258118226732775,"w":0.13943354606628416,"h":0.011663003329134947,"text":"He was back here 7"},{"x":0.20695348535516481,"y":0.40400305486756682,"w":0.095896949768066425,"h":0.011761331836150912,"text":"_a few days."},{"h":0.013081394961037107,"w":0.33333332061767579,"text":"Hm, well that brings me to another point. The","x":0.056644880976565302,"y":0.41715116300882249},{"w":0.30718954086303707,"h":0.011694469420141629,"text":"government want to improve\/ improving","x":0.056644877144734235,"y":0.43168604688900236},{"x":0.056644887646763495,"h":0.013081394961037107,"y":0.44331395362776638,"w":0.35511981964111328,"text":"conditions in young offenders' prisons. But some"},{"y":0.45784883761090156,"text":"people say that this is wrong. They say that these","w":0.35729846954345706,"h":0.011759821917988966,"x":0.056644876920355892},{"w":0.37037036895751951,"text":"are young people who have committed crimes and","h":0.011700520606759524,"x":0.056644877177013699,"y":0.47085761868156362},{"h":0.013322231473771873,"y":0.48251457110102369,"x":0.056644881361552102,"w":0.35294116973876954,"text":"they should dto be punished \/ be punished. One"},{"y":0.49708576192616893,"w":0.36819171905517578,"text":"prison guard said, 'They have education, they have","h":0.013088656702605395,"x":0.05882353411801837},{"y":0.50999167349363461,"w":0.38344226837158202,"text":"a gym and television - it's like a holiday camp!' What","h":0.013322231473771873,"x":0.056644874093076183},{"text":"do you say to that?"